{
  "description": "plate [0,0,0]–[100,100,10] minus two through holes of radius 3 at (50, 50), one tool repeated by value — a second body of the same geometry, every face of it coincident with the first's: the two walls cut the plate's faces along one circle, held as one section edge. One hole, genus 1",
